{"sectionId":"cell/transport-detail","items":[{"id":"cell--transport-detail-k001","sectionId":"cell/transport-detail","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"이온 통로는 전기화학적 기울기에 따른 빠른 흐름을 제공하고 voltage, ligand, mechanical force 등으로 개폐될 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--transport-detail-k002","sectionId":"cell/transport-detail","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"carrier는 기질 결합과 구조 전환을 통해 수송하며 포화와 경쟁을 보일 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--transport-detail-k003","sectionId":"cell/transport-detail","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"uniport는 한 기질, symport는 여러 기질 같은 방향, antiport는 반대 방향 이동이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--transport-detail-k004","sectionId":"cell/transport-detail","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"전기발생성 수송은 순전하 이동을 일으킨다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--transport-detail-k005","sectionId":"cell/transport-detail","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"Na⁺/K⁺ 펌프, H⁺/K⁺ 펌프, SERCA 등 P형 ATPase는 인산화 중간체를 사용한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--transport-detail-k006","sectionId":"cell/transport-detail","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"V형 ATPase는 리소좀과 소낭 등의 내강 산성화에 기여한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--transport-detail-k007","sectionId":"cell/transport-detail","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"F형 ATP synthase는 일반적으로 양성자 기울기로 ATP를 합성하지만 조건에 따라 역작동할 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--transport-detail-k008","sectionId":"cell/transport-detail","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"ABC transporter는 ATP 결합·가수분해를 이용하며 CFTR은 ABC 계열이지만 조절성 Cl⁻ 통로인 예외이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--transport-detail-k009","sectionId":"cell/transport-detail","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"GLUT는 촉진확산, SGLT는 Na⁺ 기울기 이용 공동수송이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--transport-detail-k010","sectionId":"cell/transport-detail","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"aquaporin은 물 이동을 촉진한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--transport-detail-k011","sectionId":"cell/transport-detail","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"이온의 순흐름은 농도차뿐 아니라 전기적 퍼텐셜 차에 의해 결정된다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--transport-detail-k012","sectionId":"cell/transport-detail","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"GLUT: 촉진확산, SGLT: 2차 능동수송.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--transport-detail-k013","sectionId":"cell/transport-detail","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"P형 ATPase는 인산화 중간체를 사용한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--transport-detail-k014","sectionId":"cell/transport-detail","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"CFTR은 ABC 계열 Cl⁻ 통로이다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--transport-detail-k015","sectionId":"cell/transport-detail","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"막단백질 수송은 이온 또는 용질의 전기화학적 퍼텐셜 차를 고려한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--transport-detail-k016","sectionId":"cell/transport-detail","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"일반적으로 감소한다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]}]}